nt-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库集成</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >来自不同系统和数据源的数据，将其统一的存储和管理</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，消除数据冗余和不一致性。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"289"  src=3D"~tmp{dfc5859c-3569-48d5-b0df-70f88f9be25c}135022.files/~tmp{dfc5859c-3569-48d5-b0df-70f88f9be25c}1350224230.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >举例说明</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >商品系统和下单系统的数据是各自的业务系统数据库分开存储</font> , 而我们的数据仓库呢? 比如一个券的投放, 我们需要分析券的曝光 、券的领取、 券的核销情况, 券的曝光来自流量采集上报, 券的领取来自权益系统, 券的核销来自交易系统,&nbsp; 如果没有数仓来集中储存数据, 我们需要某些数据, 需要单独到对应系统下取数据 , 比如跑到权益系统数据库跑一个领取的数据, 跑到交易系统跑一个交易的数据,&nbsp; 假如需要另外一个数据, 又要跑到其他系统来取数, 这个还不是最头疼的, 最头痛的是各个系统数据是分散的, 没有办法进行关联分析. 而且数据库并不是为分析而生, 查询数据一定带来很多的性能压力.</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >怎么办</font>? 其实目的就是解决这个问题, 那把所有的数据集成到一起就可以了, 数据仓库的其中一个使命也是为了存储不同的数据嘛. </span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >于是集成性就成了数据仓库的第二大特点</font>;</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >我们知道业务系统经常会有增删改的操作</font> ,比如一个指标管理系统, 某个指标口径发生变化了, 我们在前端的页面就会修改这个数据, 所以改是避免不了的 ,但是数据仓库呢? 数据仓库并不产生数据, 而是集成业务系统的数据 .</span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2.3 相对稳定性</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库的数据是稳定的、可靠的，不会频繁变化，以保证决策分析的准确性和一致性。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >举例说明：</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >OLTP型数据库中的数据通常实时更新，数据根据需要及时发生变化, 涉及到大量的增删改</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >。数据仓库的数据主要</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >供企业决策分析之用</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，属于</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >OLAP型数据库</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >所</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >涉及的数据操作主要是数据加载和数据查询</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，一旦某个数据进入数据仓库以后，一般情况下将被长期保留，也就是数据仓库中一般有大量的查询操作，但修改和删除操作很少，通常只需要定期的加载、刷新。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >实战说明</font>: </span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据入仓</font> ,入仓之后并不会时不时更新和删除操作, 特别强调下这个更新操作, 数据仓库的管理工具Hive是不支持Upsert、Del</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >e</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >te操作, </span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >我们即使更新和删除操作</font>, 也不是真正的更新</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;,而且这个更新和删除操作支持的级别是表或者分区(如果有的话), 所以本质上数据</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >仓库</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >只有两种行为数据加载和数据查询</font> .所以比起业务数据库就比较稳定了;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >【</font><font face=3D"宋体" >Hive 更新/删除操作底层原理笔记】</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >一、根本原因（为什么不能直接改）：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >底层存储是</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >HDFS，其核心特性是“一次写入，多次读取”，文件一旦生成就无法在物理硬盘上原地修改某一行数据。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >二、实现</font><font face=3D"宋体" >“更新/删除”的两种方式：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >1. 传统模式（非事务表）—— 全量覆写</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >不修改原文件，而是将整个表</font><font face=3D"宋体" >/分区的数据全部读出来，在内存中修改目标行后，重新生成一份全新的文件覆盖旧文件。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >（比喻：为了改错别字，把整本作业本重新抄写一遍装订好）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2. 现代模式（事务表 ACID）—— 增量补丁</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >不重写旧文件，而是额外生成一个记录变更的</font><font face=3D"宋体" >“增量小文件”（补丁）。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >查询时，系统自动合并原始数据</font> <font face=3D"宋体" >+ 补丁文件，逻辑上返回修改后的结果，物理上旧数据依旧躺在硬盘上。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=3D"宋体" >（比喻：在原文上贴一张便利贴盖住旧字，老师和同学只看便利贴上的新内容）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >三、核心结论（必背）：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >Hive 的表层语法（SQL）虽支持 Update/Delete，但底层物理存储本质仍为“新文件替换旧文件”或“追加补丁合并”，绝对不是像 MySQL 那样在硬盘上原地擦写数据块。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >2.4 反映历史变化</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库是反映历史变化的，</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" >OLTP型</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据库主要关心当前某一个时间段内的数据，而数据仓库中的数据通常包含历史信息，系统</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >记录企业从过去某一时点</font>(如开始应用数据仓库的时点)到目前的各个阶段的信息</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >，通过这些信息，可以对企业的发展历程和未来趋势做出定量分析和预测。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"15"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >实战说明</font>:</span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >我们知道数据库并不是无限扩展的</font>, 这个跟数据库自身的技术特性有关, 即使有分库分表 ,数据量大了就会有性能瓶颈. 所以数据库一定不是为了存储历史全量数据而生的, 但是数据仓库不是 , </span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >数据仓库就是为了分析而生</font>, 分析是有从历史至今的数据分析的需求的, 所以相比数据库一定是要存储足够多的历史数据 ,所以数据仓库创建表之前 都需要评估数据表的生命周期.&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

